OL,3,ANHS staff investigated over access to
OL,4,Adead teenager's medical records
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a teenage boy who died in
OL,7,Fhospital has said she is "deeply
OL,8,Fconcerned and hurt" after learning his
OL,9,Fmedical records may have been accessed
OL,10,Finappropriately for years after his
OL,11,Fdeath.
OL,13,FPaula McGowan, whose 18-year-old
OL,14,Fautistic son Oliver died in 2016, was
OL,15,Ftold that at least five members of
OL,16,Fstaff at Bristol Foundation NHS Trust
OL,17,Fmay have accessed his records without
OL,18,Fpermission as recently as this year.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
