OL,3,ANHS staff investigated over access to
OL,4,Adead teenager's medical records
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree nursing staff are under formal
OL,7,Finvestigation, while a doctor who no
OL,8,Flonger works for the trust has
OL,9,Fself-referred to the General Medical
OL,10,FCouncil. Another member of staff is
OL,11,Fhaving their case reviewed separately.
OL,13,FThe trust said it was "deeply sorry"
OL,14,Ffor any stress and anxiety caused.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
